description: Deeply review and revise a {{backend.displayName}} ticket's execution plan or fix plan against current code, regression risks, edge cases, layer boundaries, and verification depth. Use after describe-ticket or plan-fix, or when asked to stress-test a plan before implementation. Returns the revised plan, not just findings; does not review a PR for merge readiness.
argument-hint: "{{eg.prefixUpper}}-NNN"
